    "Pounce cannot read the clipboard history key from the keychain. Nothing was deleted." : {
      "comment" : "Clipboard banner when the keychain denied access to the key",
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Pounce cannot read the clipboard history key from the keychain. Nothing was deleted."
          }
        },
        "pl" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Pounce nie może odczytać klucza historii schowka z pęku kluczy. Nic nie zostało usunięte."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Pounce cannot start" : {
      "comment" : "Alert title when the app cannot prepare its data directory",
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Pounce cannot start"
          }
        },
        "pl" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Nie można uruchomić Pounce"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Pounce finds files and folders by name, using its own index that stays on this Mac. It never reads what is inside your files." : {
      "comment" : "File search onboarding text",
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Pounce finds files and folders by name, using its own index that stays on this Mac. It never reads what is inside your files."
          }
        },
        "pl" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Pounce znajduje pliki i foldery po nazwie, korzystając z własnego indeksu, który zostaje na tym Macu. Nigdy nie czyta zawartości Twoich plików."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Pounce is not allowed to read the clipboard, so nothing is recorded." : {
      "comment" : "Clipboard banner when pasteboard access is denied in Privacy settings",
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Pounce is not allowed to read the clipboard, so nothing is recorded."
          }
        },
        "pl" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Brak dostępu do schowka: Pounce nie może go czytać, więc nic nie jest zapisywane."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Pounce keeps what you copy so you can paste it again with ⌘⇧V. The history stays on this Mac, encrypted, for 30 days or 1000 entries." : {
      "comment" : "Clipboard onboarding text",
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Pounce keeps what you copy so you can paste it again with ⌘⇧V. The history stays on this Mac, encrypted, for 30 days or 1000 entries."
          }
        },
        "pl" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Pounce zapamiętuje to, co kopiujesz, aby można było wkleić to ponownie skrótem ⌘⇧V. Historia zostaje na tym Macu, zaszyfrowana, przez 30 dni lub do 1000 wpisów."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Pounce moves the results you pick often to the top. Resetting forgets what it learned; your apps, files and clipboard history stay." : {
      "comment" : "Settings explanation of Reset Ranking",
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Pounce moves the results you pick often to the top. Resetting forgets what it learned; your apps, files and clipboard history stay."
          }
        },
        "pl" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Pounce przesuwa na górę wyniki, które często wybierasz. Reset zapomina to, czego się nauczył; aplikacje, pliki i historia schowka zostają."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Pounce never asks for a permission on its own. Changes in System Settings apply right away." : {
      "comment" : "Settings → Permissions footer",
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Pounce never asks for a permission on its own. Changes in System Settings apply right away."
          }
        },
        "pl" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Pounce nigdy sam nie prosi o uprawnienia. Zmiany w Ustawieniach systemowych działają od razu."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Pounce opens with a shortcut from anywhere and lives in the menu bar. The next steps set it up; you can skip any of them and change everything later in Settings." : {
      "comment" : "Welcome screen introduction",
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Pounce opens with a shortcut from anywhere and lives in the menu bar. The next steps set it up; you can skip any of them and change everything later in Settings."
          }
        },
        "pl" : {
